
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Device Simulator
    participant API as FastAPI Controller
    participant DB as In-memory Device Registry
    participant CM as Campaign Manager

    D->>API: POST /devices/{id}/inform
    Note over D,API: deviceId, firmwareVersion, event
    API->>DB: Register or update device
    DB-->>API: Device record updated

    alt Event is CONNECTION_REQUEST
        API->>CM: Find eligible campaign
        CM-->>API: Matching campaign or none
        alt Eligible and no active attempt
            API-->>D: 200 OK + DOWNLOAD command
        else No eligible campaign
            API-->>D: 200 OK + empty commands
        end
    else BOOT or PERIODIC
        API-->>D: 200 OK + empty commands
    else TRANSFER_COMPLETE
        API->>CM: Correlate commandKey and update attempt
        CM-->>API: Outcome recorded or key unknown
        API-->>D: 200 OK + empty commands
    end

